Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 04:46:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 19/49] S020 (prune): the two count checks of the used-blob set
 read its arrays

From the S020 incumbent (T2). PlanPrune checks twice that every used
blob has a count in a range (found at least once; exactly once after
duplicates are handled). With one final index and no overflow entries
the check reads the set's own arrays; in every other state it walks
All() as before.

New: internal/repository/index/associated_count_validate.go and its
tests, internal/repository/prune_count_validate_test.go.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
